 34CL c  {+35}Cl+|g|)1n+{+34}Cl from J|p=3/2+ {+35}Cl ground state.             
 34CL c  1997Is02: E|g{-max}=32 MeV. The target was LiCl with natural (75.8%)   
 34CL2c  {+35}Cl. Measured decay photons with Ge(Li) detector but they report   
 34CL3c  only excitation energies I|b {+34}Cl. Also given are J|p and C{+2}S    
 34CL4c  values taken from 1990En08 and 1978En02. Studied the mechanism         
 34CL5c  responsible for formation and decay of giant dipole resonances.        
 34CL c  Other: 1974Ve06 measured cross sections of (|g,n), (|g,np), (|g,2n) at 
 34CL2c  E=8-30 MeV.                                                            
